        "title": "Ask about selection, evaluation and degree",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "Put question words where the answer belongs. 哪/哪些 ask for a selection, 怎么样 asks for an evaluation, and 多 + adjective asks about degree.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "哪本书是你的？",
                "pinyin": "nǎ běn shū shì nǐ de ？",
                "meaning": "Which book is yours?",
